WEBVTT

00:10.960 --> 00:12.710
This is how I'll become...

00:15.670 --> 00:17.460
This is how I'll become...

00:19.630 --> 00:21.250
...Supreme Commander.

00:21.670 --> 00:22.920
...a hero.

00:23.330 --> 00:25.000
This is my story!

02:05.000 --> 02:08.710
<b>Blitz, Sahara, Twinkle</b>

02:05.540 --> 02:08.750
THAT'S what she meant by
"physically demanding"?!

02:09.290 --> 02:10.540
No fair!

02:14.210 --> 02:16.960
Things are heating up out here, folks!

02:16.960 --> 02:18.920
Up next in Round 2:

02:18.920 --> 02:21.080
It's Shushu Suruga
of the 7th Squadron versus...

02:21.080 --> 02:22.130
Hell yeah!

02:22.130 --> 02:24.630
...Sahara Wakasa of the 6th Squadron!

02:26.040 --> 02:29.040
Both competitors specialize
in hand-to-hand combat!

02:29.040 --> 02:31.540
I have a feeling this is gonna be
an intense battle!

02:31.750 --> 02:34.880
Watch this, Yukki.
I'm about to clobber this girl.

02:34.880 --> 02:35.710
Okay.

02:35.710 --> 02:38.290
And maybe you'll show me
some appreciation afterwards, eh?

02:38.290 --> 02:39.080
Huh?

02:48.080 --> 02:49.380
Yachiho!

02:49.380 --> 02:53.040
Since you lost your match...
you get to be our cheerleader.

02:53.630 --> 02:55.380
Good luck, Sahara!

02:55.750 --> 02:57.250
You can count on me!

02:57.250 --> 02:59.210
I'll make you proud!

03:01.880 --> 03:03.880
We both like to get up close and personal,

03:03.880 --> 03:06.380
so how 'bout we hold off
on using our abilities till later?

03:06.380 --> 03:07.710
Sure thing!

03:08.250 --> 03:09.790
Ready, set...

03:09.790 --> 03:11.290
GO!

03:11.290 --> 03:12.000
Here I come!

03:12.000 --> 03:12.500
Sahara starts off with a ferocious kick!
Here I come!<b></b>

03:12.500 --> 03:14.130
Sahara starts off with a ferocious kick!

03:14.630 --> 03:17.040
But Shushu grabs her by the leg and...

03:17.330 --> 03:19.040
SLAMS her!

03:19.920 --> 03:22.540
She follows it up with an elbow drop!

03:22.960 --> 03:24.830
Ow!

03:25.290 --> 03:28.000
Sahara grabs Shushu from behind and...

03:28.330 --> 03:31.460
hits her with a German suplex!

03:32.500 --> 03:33.830
It ain't over yet!

03:34.540 --> 03:37.130
Ugh, I'm tired...

03:37.670 --> 03:39.580
That was long enough...

03:39.580 --> 03:41.540
Break out the abilities!

03:41.540 --> 03:42.420
Already?!

03:42.420 --> 03:44.670
Aw! It was just starting to get good!

03:44.670 --> 03:46.130
Fine, I'll use mine, too!

03:46.130 --> 03:48.210
How many do you think she'll do?

03:48.210 --> 03:49.540
Just one?

03:49.540 --> 03:51.250
I'd guess three or so.

03:51.960 --> 03:54.790
Both of their abilities
center around physical strength...

03:54.790 --> 03:56.830
This will be a short match.

03:56.830 --> 03:58.830
Paradigm Shift!

03:58.830 --> 04:00.210
<b>PARADIGM</b>

03:58.830 --> 04:00.210
<b>SHIFT</b>

04:02.710 --> 04:05.540
Ooh, how neat!

04:05.540 --> 04:07.210
'Kay, it's my turn!

04:07.210 --> 04:08.670
Mad...

04:08.920 --> 04:10.170
Sheep!

04:10.170 --> 04:11.540
<b>MAD SHEEP</b>

04:11.880 --> 04:13.040
Three!

04:13.040 --> 04:15.630
And... WHAM!

04:19.210 --> 04:22.670
Paper beats... ROCK!

04:25.670 --> 04:28.000
I win rock-paper-scissors!

04:28.000 --> 04:29.710
You totally cheated!

04:29.710 --> 04:33.210
Sahara unleashed her "Mad Sheep" ability!

04:33.420 --> 04:35.750
It allows her to boost her strength

04:35.750 --> 04:38.750
for the precise amount of time
she specifies in advance!

04:38.750 --> 04:41.580
One minute minimum,
60 minutes maximum!

04:41.790 --> 04:45.710
The shorter the amount of time allotted,
the stronger she gets!

04:45.710 --> 04:50.040
However, her ability has a mandatory
three-minute cooldown period!

04:50.040 --> 04:52.830
Nice move! Keep it up, Sahara!

04:52.830 --> 04:53.960
Why, you...

04:59.210 --> 05:01.290
O-owie!

05:01.540 --> 05:02.380
Ow-ow-ow...

05:02.380 --> 05:06.580
Sure, your size is impressive,
but it makes you easy to dodge!

05:07.830 --> 05:10.500
And it makes you an easy target!

05:21.670 --> 05:22.880
Shushu?!

05:25.040 --> 05:26.710
Yukki...

05:26.710 --> 05:29.670
You don't have to
give me that look, y'know...

05:30.040 --> 05:32.080
Well? Are you ready to give up now?

05:32.080 --> 05:34.830
Give up? You're joking, right?

05:34.830 --> 05:37.000
This match is just getting started!

05:37.330 --> 05:39.580
Wow, you've got guts!

05:39.580 --> 05:41.290
It's weird to me, too.

05:41.290 --> 05:43.330
Why am I so determined?

05:44.000 --> 05:47.040
C'mon, Shushu!
Having a boyfriend is fun!

05:47.330 --> 05:49.670
Jeez, you sound like a broken record...

05:49.670 --> 05:51.920
I just don't get
why you're so opposed to it!

05:52.500 --> 05:55.040
There's never a dull moment with him...

05:55.040 --> 05:59.630
And seeing that look of joy on his face?
It's the best feeling in the world!

05:59.630 --> 06:00.630
Whoa.

06:00.630 --> 06:05.080
It's rare to find a girl
so devoted to her man nowadays.

06:05.080 --> 06:06.130
Nah...

06:06.130 --> 06:08.670
I'm not interested in
a romance with some dude.

06:08.670 --> 06:11.460
I want something more exciting, y'know?

06:14.290 --> 06:18.330
<b>Member Recruitment     Language Settings</b>

06:14.580 --> 06:17.040
Been thinkin' about
joining these guys lately!

06:17.540 --> 06:20.630
If I went to Mato,
I bet I'd never get bored!

06:20.630 --> 06:23.210
Every day would be a total blast!

06:23.210 --> 06:24.500
Very on-brand.

06:24.500 --> 06:25.500
Isn't it?

06:25.500 --> 06:28.170
Hm. I guess you
just wouldn't understand...

06:28.170 --> 06:30.250
But you'll get it one of these days!

06:32.540 --> 06:35.080
Keep your eyes on me, Yukki...

06:35.580 --> 06:37.500
'Cause I'm about to win!

06:38.080 --> 06:39.880
Don'tcha think you'd have an easier time

06:39.880 --> 06:42.040
moving around
if you were a little smaller?

06:42.040 --> 06:44.710
It's always important
to assess the situation at hand

06:44.710 --> 06:46.630
and tailor your ability accordingly!

06:46.630 --> 06:48.380
Smaller would be better?

06:48.380 --> 06:51.080
That kind of self-control is a snoozefest!

06:52.420 --> 06:56.670
I live my life by a single motto:
Go big or go home!

06:56.670 --> 06:58.500
Paradigm Shift!

06:58.880 --> 07:00.790
I'll make my body even bigger...

07:00.500 --> 07:02.380
<b>PARADIGM SHIFT</b>

07:00.500 --> 07:02.380
<b>PUSH THE ENVELOPE!</b>

07:00.790 --> 07:02.420
and push the envelope!

07:07.210 --> 07:08.540
I didn't see that coming...

07:08.540 --> 07:11.460
And... BANG!

07:28.920 --> 07:31.630
I was too big for you to dodge, wasn't I?

07:34.670 --> 07:35.630
Take this!

07:50.790 --> 07:53.710
Hey, ref.
Can you see if she's unconscious?

07:53.710 --> 07:55.000
U-uh, sure!

07:55.000 --> 07:56.130
She did it...

07:55.000 --> 07:59.580
<b>7th Squadron</b>

07:56.670 --> 07:58.540
Miss Shushu won her match!

07:58.540 --> 07:59.630
Yeah!

08:01.040 --> 08:02.080
One!

08:02.710 --> 08:03.630
Two!

08:12.960 --> 08:14.130
She got back up?!

08:16.040 --> 08:18.210
That's part of Sahara's ability!

08:18.210 --> 08:20.920
If she loses consciousness
while her ability is active,

08:20.920 --> 08:23.670
her heightened killer instincts
take control of her body,

08:23.670 --> 08:26.460
which then continues the fight on its own!

08:29.750 --> 08:32.290
She'll attack enemies and allies alike...

08:32.920 --> 08:35.630
But it only makes her
that much more powerful.

08:38.460 --> 08:40.920
Sahara can sleep anytime, anywhere.

08:40.920 --> 08:43.000
It's her secret weapon.

08:45.790 --> 08:49.580
One! Two! Three!

08:50.500 --> 08:51.830
It's all over!

08:52.580 --> 08:55.170
The winner is: Sahara Wakasa!

08:58.790 --> 09:01.500
All because of my
glorious cheerleading skills!

09:01.500 --> 09:03.670
She took her down
in exactly three minutes.

09:06.500 --> 09:07.460
Shushu!

09:07.460 --> 09:08.790
Are you all right?!

09:08.790 --> 09:12.580
No need to worry.
I got her all patched up.

09:17.460 --> 09:19.000
Y-your chest!

09:20.630 --> 09:21.460
Hey! Come on, get off me!

09:21.460 --> 09:23.960
Oh... I must've...
Hey! Come on, get off me!<b></b>

09:24.500 --> 09:25.710
Here, take this!

09:25.710 --> 09:26.630
Shushu.

09:27.960 --> 09:29.080
Commander...

09:30.630 --> 09:33.710
I'm sorry for losing my match...

09:33.710 --> 09:37.380
You almost had her.
We'll discuss where you can improve later.

09:37.920 --> 09:40.040
I think you'd better go get changed.

09:40.040 --> 09:41.000
'Kay.

09:47.130 --> 09:48.920
I looked like an idiot...

09:48.920 --> 09:51.710
and Yukki saw the whole thing.

10:07.500 --> 10:08.670
Shushu?

10:13.080 --> 10:16.630
Um... Do you want anything to drink?

10:16.630 --> 10:19.000
I can grab it for you
while you get dressed.

10:19.000 --> 10:21.710
Nah, I'm good...

10:21.710 --> 10:24.920
If there's anything I can do,
just let me know.

10:25.580 --> 10:26.920
Since I'm the caretaker...

10:29.040 --> 10:34.290
Okay, then erase my memories
of that pitiful excuse for a match.

10:37.960 --> 10:40.290
I think it sucks you didn't win, but...

10:41.540 --> 10:43.880
I don't think it was pitiful at all!

10:47.000 --> 10:48.330
Really?

10:48.920 --> 10:50.500
In all honesty,

10:50.500 --> 10:53.460
I wish I'd gotten to see more
of the wrestling you did at the start!

10:54.710 --> 10:57.540
You would've
if she hadn't been a buzzkill.

11:03.380 --> 11:04.710
Hey, Yukki?

11:05.750 --> 11:07.960
Can you close your eyes for a sec?

11:09.790 --> 11:10.790
Sure...

11:26.000 --> 11:27.210
Shushu?!

11:31.420 --> 11:34.250
To be fair, I did tell you
to close your eyes...

11:34.750 --> 11:36.750
Wh-why did you kiss me just now?!

11:36.750 --> 11:38.250
Well...

11:44.540 --> 11:47.750
I figured I'd chase the shock of losing
with an even bigger shock!

11:47.750 --> 11:49.040
That's a power move!

11:54.250 --> 11:58.630
I can't tell him
until I get him to like me more.

12:02.630 --> 12:05.290
Sense any anomalies in Mato, Nei?

12:07.130 --> 12:08.250
No...

12:11.750 --> 12:13.630
There's nothing out of the...

12:18.130 --> 12:19.170
Huh?

12:24.040 --> 12:25.380
A spy?

12:25.630 --> 12:28.630
Wow, we only just broke our cover.

12:28.630 --> 12:30.040
Not bad.

12:30.210 --> 12:35.000
Tell the others I say hello...
and that the battle begins now.

12:41.040 --> 12:42.790
Wh-who was that?

12:42.790 --> 12:44.960
What's wrong, Nei?
Did you see something?

12:45.420 --> 12:46.580
I...

12:53.630 --> 12:54.830
Shuuki?!

12:55.210 --> 12:57.040
Where in the world are they coming from?!

12:59.580 --> 13:01.670
You can totally chillax!

13:01.670 --> 13:03.830
My barrier is impenetrable-

13:05.080 --> 13:07.420
THIS flimsy thing is a barrier?

13:08.250 --> 13:09.330
A humanoid?!

13:09.330 --> 13:14.290
The absurdity fills me, Rairen,
with THUNDEROUS laughter!

13:18.210 --> 13:20.830
No way! It cracked my barrier?!

13:20.830 --> 13:22.630
We're calling off the exhibition match!

13:24.330 --> 13:27.920
Bunch of pests.
It's about time you went extinct.

13:27.920 --> 13:29.750
You're a dying breed.

13:31.290 --> 13:33.380
All hands, prepare for battle!

13:34.210 --> 13:35.330
Tenka!

13:35.330 --> 13:36.210
On it.

13:36.210 --> 13:38.130
I'll take the non-combatants to the dorm.

13:38.790 --> 13:41.290
And have Nei give you her recon report!

13:43.330 --> 13:45.080
Destroy every last Shuuki!

13:45.080 --> 13:46.250
Yes, ma'am!

13:49.670 --> 13:51.380
Let me handle this one!

13:55.460 --> 13:56.830
Commander!

13:57.630 --> 13:58.790
Shushu!

13:59.750 --> 14:00.790
Can you fight?

14:01.130 --> 14:02.040
Yup!

14:03.830 --> 14:05.330
Paradigm Shift!

14:06.790 --> 14:08.960
Have a taste of my boot!

14:10.210 --> 14:12.580
I'm already feeling way better!

14:13.670 --> 14:14.830
Take this!

14:17.170 --> 14:19.080
Don't let up on the crowd control!

14:19.080 --> 14:20.460
I'll cover your six!

14:26.170 --> 14:27.500
Not them...

14:27.500 --> 14:28.500
Going somewhere?

14:29.290 --> 14:30.500
I'm your opponent!

14:34.170 --> 14:35.670
Not you, either...

14:36.170 --> 14:39.000
But perhaps I'll burn you
to a crisp first!

14:43.670 --> 14:44.710
Oh?

14:45.790 --> 14:46.710
Yachiho!

14:46.710 --> 14:47.710
Himari...

14:50.710 --> 14:52.830
He's gonna be a tough nut to crack.

15:02.500 --> 15:03.670
Just now...

15:03.670 --> 15:07.880
You stepped in because you knew
the lightning was coming ahead of time.

15:08.790 --> 15:11.960
Bastard! You'll pay for that!

15:15.330 --> 15:16.330
Commander!

15:16.920 --> 15:18.880
Let me ride on Yuuki's back with you!

15:18.880 --> 15:20.250
WITH her?

15:20.250 --> 15:21.920
Two people at the same time?!

15:21.920 --> 15:23.960
But we've never tried that before-

15:23.960 --> 15:24.960
All right.

15:26.210 --> 15:27.540
Just trust me.

15:32.330 --> 15:34.290
Let's go, Himari. The three of us.

15:34.290 --> 15:35.170
Yes, ma'am!

15:36.330 --> 15:37.630
I've got a gut feeling...

15:38.670 --> 15:42.960
that with two masters,
he'll take on a more powerful form.

15:58.670 --> 15:59.540
<b>ETERNAL CHAINS: SLAVE</b>

16:01.080 --> 16:01.960
<b>WAR CLOUD</b>

16:07.330 --> 16:09.380
<b>ETERNAL CHAINS: SLAVE</b>

16:07.330 --> 16:09.380
<b>WAR CLOUD</b>

16:12.750 --> 16:15.710
What do you think
of your new powers, Yuuki?!

16:16.000 --> 16:17.420
Let's give 'em hell!

16:17.420 --> 16:19.960
The power's coursing through me...

16:20.920 --> 16:22.580
I bet I could do it now...

16:22.580 --> 16:24.420
That move she did back then.

16:25.710 --> 16:29.080
I'll use the same method as Brand Break
to channel my energy.

16:29.630 --> 16:31.040
Howling Blast!

16:29.630 --> 16:31.000
<b>HOWLING BLAST</b>

16:36.330 --> 16:38.170
So THAT'S what having two masters does!

16:38.170 --> 16:39.040
Perfect!

16:39.040 --> 16:41.130
Now we can annihilate the whole swarm!

16:41.130 --> 16:42.460
But what about Yachiho?!

16:42.460 --> 16:45.540
She'll be fine.
The 6th Squadron has HER.

16:45.880 --> 16:47.420
They've got Tenka.

16:47.420 --> 16:49.500
Two additional humanoids?

16:49.500 --> 16:50.420
Yes.

16:50.420 --> 16:53.210
I can't see them right now,
but I'm sure of it...

16:53.210 --> 16:55.210
Huh... All right then.

16:55.500 --> 16:56.670
We'll take it from here.

17:05.130 --> 17:06.960
I won't let you outshine me.

17:10.750 --> 17:13.670
We'll give 'em something better
than an exhibition match...

17:13.960 --> 17:16.500
We'll give 'em a commander showdown!

17:18.500 --> 17:19.790
This is torture!

17:19.790 --> 17:21.750
Lady Ten and Lady Kyou
are out there fighting,

17:21.750 --> 17:23.210
and I'm stuck here?!

17:23.210 --> 17:25.960
It's because the dorm
has the sturdiest barrier.

17:27.000 --> 17:29.210
But I can barely see from so far away!

17:29.790 --> 17:31.290
I wanna watch!

17:31.710 --> 17:33.330
I wanna watch up close!

17:33.330 --> 17:35.830
Um, if you put your hand
on Nei's shoulder,

17:35.830 --> 17:38.880
she'll link with your mind
so you can watch the fight.

17:38.880 --> 17:40.250
Seriously?!

17:40.500 --> 17:43.920
Omigosh, Miss Okawamura!
You're totally the best!

17:44.460 --> 17:46.830
I can see them! This is awesome!

17:51.460 --> 17:53.920
It's time... to bow down!

17:54.250 --> 17:56.710
Yeah, look at her go!

17:56.920 --> 17:59.250
Shuuki can't be beaten
with normal weapons.

17:59.250 --> 18:01.710
The power of Mato, granted by Peaches,

18:01.710 --> 18:04.920
and specially made weapons
imbued with the Peaches' power

18:04.920 --> 18:06.830
are the only ways to counter them.

18:07.580 --> 18:09.710
But the exception to that is Lady Kyou.

18:09.710 --> 18:11.000
Kyouka Uzen!

18:13.210 --> 18:14.920
She trained atop a sacred mountain

18:14.920 --> 18:18.170
to perfect her own unique style of combat
that destroys the creatures!

18:18.170 --> 18:20.330
She gained the skills necessary
to defeat Shuuki

18:20.330 --> 18:22.880
without relying on her Peach ability!

18:23.130 --> 18:25.000
And this exceptional nature of hers

18:25.000 --> 18:27.380
is how she landed her position
as commander!

18:31.920 --> 18:34.920
I can't believe I get to see Lady Kyou's
strength up close!

18:34.920 --> 18:37.170
It's a dream come true for a fan like me!

18:37.880 --> 18:40.750
Lady Kyou's ability
is stronger than ever, too!

18:40.750 --> 18:42.420
This is totally wicked!

18:44.080 --> 18:45.540
Golden Hour!

18:46.420 --> 18:47.630
Freeze for five seconds!

18:47.630 --> 18:49.290
<b>AZUMA TIME: GOLDEN HOUR</b>

18:57.460 --> 18:58.920
I'm not done yet!

19:03.960 --> 19:06.330
Dammit... That's a lot of firepower!

19:06.330 --> 19:08.290
This is what these humanoids
are capable of?!

19:14.170 --> 19:17.130
Can't do that sneaky pose of yours
without an arm!

19:18.880 --> 19:20.130
You're a fool!

19:20.130 --> 19:24.880
One as elegant as I
can pose no matter how many limbs I have!

19:25.130 --> 19:26.460
Golden Hour!

19:26.830 --> 19:28.000
Rewind five seconds!

19:26.830 --> 19:29.500
<b>AZUMA TIME: GOLDEN HOUR</b>

19:38.960 --> 19:41.290
Persistent little pest, aren't you?

19:54.830 --> 19:56.790
My body's all warmed up.

19:58.210 --> 20:00.460
I'll obliterate you with this next strike.

20:15.500 --> 20:17.080
Good job, Yachiho.

20:18.790 --> 20:20.080
That woman...

20:20.080 --> 20:22.540
Where'd she come from all of a sudden?

20:25.170 --> 20:26.380
Let's swap.

20:26.830 --> 20:28.460
You go take it easy.

20:34.630 --> 20:35.880
Take it easy?

20:35.880 --> 20:39.210
While my entire army is closing in on you?

20:39.580 --> 20:40.830
Army?

21:05.330 --> 21:09.580
I already neutralized any Shuuki
that might try to interfere.

21:16.250 --> 21:21.330
The report indicated the existence of
another two officer-level humanoids.

21:24.040 --> 21:25.000
But first...

21:26.500 --> 21:29.000
I guess I'll start by getting rid of you.

21:30.960 --> 21:32.500
This power...

21:35.250 --> 21:38.170
Looks like I get to have some fun.

23:11.040 --> 23:12.880
<b>TEACH US! NEI-SENPAI!</b>

23:11.290 --> 23:12.880
"Teach Us! Nei-senpai!"

23:12.880 --> 23:13.580
Okey-dokey!

23:12.880 --> 23:16.750
<b>MAD SHEEP</b>

23:13.580 --> 23:16.920
Today we're talking about Miss Sahara
Wakasa's Peach ability: Mad Sheep!

23:17.040 --> 23:18.880
Mad Sheep is a
physical fortification ability

23:18.880 --> 23:21.880
that allows her to increase her strength
for the amount of time of her choosing.

23:22.000 --> 23:24.960
She can do this for a minimum of
one minute and a maximum of 60 minutes.

23:24.960 --> 23:27.460
The shorter the timeframe,
the stronger she becomes!

23:27.460 --> 23:30.500
A nap totalling at least three minutes
is required between each usage.

23:30.500 --> 23:32.380
What's more, if she passes out
while Mad Sheep is active,

23:32.380 --> 23:34.710
she'll lose her ability to differentiate
between friends and foes,

23:34.710 --> 23:36.380
so it's best to cheer her on
from a safe distance!

23:36.500 --> 23:37.540
Anyways, next time:

23:37.540 --> 23:39.170
"United Front, Tenka, Soar"

23:37.540 --> 23:41.000
